{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_16_505898094#0_757372410","relevance":3,"reason":"This document is explicitly dedicated to the effects of stress on memory and directly states that stress can interfere with encoding and retrieval, triggers stress-hormone secretion, and can cause acute and chronic brain changes with possible long-term damage.","learned":"Stress affects memory through stress hormones and can interfere with both encoding new memories and retrieving information; acute and chronic stress can alter brain areas involved in memory."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q1222","reason":"The exact-title query is yielding dedicated stress-memory evidence; continue to collect more direct findings from the same document or related results."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1222"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_22_417391433#16_1008076675","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1222","rank":2,"snippet":"similarly to the stressors of the modern world! These are but a few examples of how stress hormones are vital to our health. The take home message here is that our body and brain maintain their normal functioning ( homeostasis) through the delicate and precise interactions between many systems. The stress response system and its end product cortisol are key players in these interactions. When the cortisol system becomes deregulated, it affects all other systems that depend on its integrity to function. Stress WHAT IS STRESS? History of stress Biology of stress Stressors UNDERSTAND YOUR STRESS Recipe for stress Recognize your stress Acute vs. chronic stress Stages of chronic stress Types of chronic stress TRICK YOUR STRESS Principles of stress management Coping strategies Coping with stress – To keep in mind Coping with stress: Quick tricks Long-term stress management<cover>EFFECTS OF STRESS ON MEMORY Stress hormones and memory Stress, emotions and memory Is your memory affected by stress?\" , \"start_char\": 6670.000000 , \"title\": \"Acute vs. chronic </cover>stress - CESH / CSHS\" , \"url\": \"https://humanstress.ca/stress/understand-your-stress/acute-vs-chronic-stress/\" }"}}
